# # /germany-imaging-atlas/
#
# https://w3id.org/germany-imaging-atlas/ redirects to the Germany Imaging
# Atlas, an interactive research dashboard of inpatient CT and MRI utilisation
# across 624 diagnoses in Germany, 2005-2024, built from the German DRG
# statistics (Research Data Centre project 4509-2021). It is the companion to a
# research article and is cited there by this address.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Mohammadhamed Mirbagheri
# Mohammadhamed.Mirbagheri@uk-augsburg.de
# GitHub username: Hamed-kalak

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://hamed-kalak.github.io/germany-imaging-atlas/$1 [R=302,L]
